  "label": "Cannabis Use",
  "description": "The phrase 'we have weed' refers to marijuana, a psychoactive drug. The meme uses this reference to imply that the dark side offers a 'benefit' (weed) to entice Snoop Dogg. This requires real-world knowledge of cannabis as a drug and its cultural associations, particularly with Black communities, to understand the meme's humor and its underlying problematic stereotype.",
